Well, being somewhat of a newcomer to the game, (Haven't even gotten through a
quest yet when not in Wiz mode), I cant't really compare the death about to be
listed with those of you dying in places like the endgame. (Boy, I'll bet it
took quite a bit of restraint to keep you from needing a new monitor. :-))

Anyways...

I was wandering through the Gnomish mines, basically mashing everything I saw,
when I get the message, The gnome purposely jumps on the polymorph trap. Well,
now I see a purple worm. Thank god it was peaceful. So, I put on my ring of
poly control, take off my armor, and proceed to make myself a red dragon.
Everything is fine and dandy, very little can stand up to its attacks. So, on
level 10 I see a cockatrice. I'm at full hp, so I walk up to it to kick its
a**. Well, I bit it once, then turned right into a nifty red dragon statue. Be
advised that if the monster you are using has a bite attack, don't attack a
cockatrice in that form. I'm sure many of you know this, but I thought I'd
mention it for those that didn't realize it. Happy hacking.

